    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-dotnet/releases/tag/Google.Maps.Places.V1-1.0.0-beta16"&gt;Google.Maps.Places.V1 version 1.0.0-beta16&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;New features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add moved_place and moved_place_id to Place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Documentation improvements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change comments in some fields in Places API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarify behavior of primary types and weekday text&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-dotnet/releases/tag/Google.Cloud.OracleDatabase.V1-1.4.0"&gt;Google.Cloud.OracleDatabase.V1 version 1.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;New features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand Oracle Database v1 API to add support for Exadata Exascale (&lt;code&gt;ExadbVmCluster&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ExascaleDbStorageVault&lt;/code&gt;), Base Database (&lt;code&gt;DbSystem&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Database&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;PluggableDatabase&lt;/code&gt;), and Networking (&lt;code&gt;OdbNetwork&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;OdbSubnet&lt;/code&gt;). Adds enhancements for Autonomous Database, including Update, Switchover, and Failover operations, CMEK support, and improved disaster recovery fields. Also includes new helper resources for versions and configurations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Documentation improvements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated comments for clarity and fixed typos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/googleapis/google-cloud-dotnet/releases/tag/Google.Cloud.AIPlatform.V1-3.52.0"&gt;Google.Cloud.AIPlatform.V1 version 3.52.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h3&gt;New features&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add FunctionResponsePart and excluded_predefined_functions in ComputerUse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
